<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT INDIA BY 8 WICKETS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT INDIA BY 8 WICKETS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies</p>
<p>beat India by eight wickets in the rain-interrupted first one</p>
<p>day international at the Queen's Park Oval on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: India - 179 all out in 48.3 overs</p>
<p>West Indies - 149 for two in 27.3 overs (S.Chanderpaul</p>
<p>83). The West Indies' target was revised to 146 off 33 overs</p>
<p>after rain delayed the start of their innings.</p>
</text>
